00:00:29.863 --> 00:00:34.467 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Tu sais, des foi

00:00:31.131 --> 00:00:35.702 size:53% position:73% line:53%
décalé. Fait qu'il y en a

00:00:32.365 --> 00:00:36.903 size:53% position:73% line:53%
