00:00:36.202 --> 00:00:40.573 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Depuis surprise

00:00:37.237 --> 00:00:41.808 size:53% position:73% line:53%
d'Omicron, ils sont comme

00:00:38.471 --> 00:00:43.043 size:53% position:73% line:53%
