00:00:45.812 --> 00:00:49.182 size:53% position:73% line:53%
EDITH LEMAY, mère de Laurent,

00:00:47.047 --> 00:00:50.383 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Collin, Léo et Mia

00:00:48.415 --> 00:00:51.618 size:53% position:73% line:53%
'école ouverte, tu ne

00:00:49.516 --> 00:00:52.852 size:53% position:73% line:53%
