00:01:34.994 --> 00:01:40.600 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Là, ça fait presque deux ans.Pa

00:01:37.730 --> 00:01:41.968 size:53% position:73% line:53%
hâte que ça finisse, là.

00:01:40.533 --> 00:01:43.303 size:53% position:73% line:53%
(rire)

00:01:40.934 --> 00:01:44.671 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Les semaines les plus longues

00:01:42.469 --> 00:01:46.006 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 vie, je pense.

00:01:43.636 --> 00:01:47.374 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Depuis, Edith Lemay a perdu

00:01:45.004 --> 00:01:48.741 size:53% position:73% line:53%
