00:01:56.616 --> 00:01:59.419 size:53% position:73% line:53%
(rire)

00:01:57.016 --> 00:02:00.753 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Oui, on a été chanceux,

00:01:58.385 --> 00:02:02.122 size:53% position:73% line:53%
